<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:lang="lzh"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>瘋人逃脫</title><title type="alternate">Feng ren tao tuo [Three Patients Leave an Asylum]</title><author>無署名（《東華報》）</author><respStmt><resp>整理與編碼</resp><name>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu)</name></respStmt></titleStmt><editionStmt><edition>Transcription dataset v0.1.0</edition></editionStmt><publicationStmt><p>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu). Dataset edition 0.1.0.</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>東華報</title><date when="1913-01-25">1913-01-25</date><idno>Tung Wah Times, 1913-01-25, p. 7, NLA news-page24092556</idno><ref target="https://trove.nla.gov.au/newspaper/page/24092556">澳洲國家圖書館 Trove</ref></bibl></sourceDesc></fileDesc></teiHeader><facsimile><surface n="7" xml:id="original-page"><graphic url="https://trove.nla.gov.au/ndp/imageservice/nla.news-page24092556/level5" /></surface></facsimile><text><body><div type="article"><pb n="7" facs="#original-page" /><p><lb n="single-1" />◎瘋人逃脫　普利士濱消息云。披爐埃翁瘋院。有瘋人三<lb n="single-2" />名。一爲瓊尼架人。一爲日本人。一爲半黑人。于星期五晚<lb n="single-3" />。以往釣魚爲名。私行逃往文厘。進入埠內。搭火車前往普<lb n="single-4" />利時濱埠。嗣後巡警跟踪而至。已將半黑瘋人捉回。餘二人<lb n="single-5" />尚無踪跡。該處居民。甚爲驚恐云。</p></div></body></text></TEI>